{"seq":2,"slug":"promise-scope-milestone","title":"承诺管理、范围蔓延与里程碑重排机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-delay-risk-brand/promise-scope-milestone","wordCount":3820,"readingTime":16,"html":"<h1 id=\"承诺管理-范围蔓延与里程碑重排机制\">承诺管理、范围蔓延与里程碑重排机制</h1><p>众筹页面上那个「预计交付：2026 年 6 月」，不是营销文案，而是一份<strong>在你还没有工厂、没有模具、没有供应商合同之前就签发的、带日期的对外契约</strong>。它与电商的「预计到货 3-5 天」有本质区别：后者是库存已在仓、运力已确定之后给出的估算，前者是<strong>不确定性最大的时刻</strong>给出的硬承诺。硬件众筹里延期是常态而非异常——Kickstarter 的帮助文档就把交付风险列为支持者须自担的核心条款。本篇处理三个工程问题：如何管理已发出的承诺、如何阻止范围蔓延吃掉时间轴、以及延期不可避免时如何做一次<strong>有界、可解释、可审计</strong>的里程碑重排（rebaselining）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺是提前签发的对外契约\">核心概念：承诺是提前签发的对外契约</h2><p>先钉死三个常被混为一谈的概念。**承诺（promise）**是对外公开、带日期的交付时间，认投阶段就以「预计交付」字段固化；<strong>范围（scope）<strong>是承诺交付的物料集合（每个档位含哪些实物、配件、加购项），直接决定 BOM 与装箱结构（参见 <a href=\"../reward-tier-pledge/reward-tier-structure-addons\">回报档位结构、加购与配件建模</a>）；<strong>里程碑（milestone）<strong>是内部推进节点（模具验收、量产下线、到仓、首波发货）。里程碑</strong>可重排</strong>，承诺</strong>对外已生效</strong>——把这层区分做进数据模型是本系统设计的第一原则。</p>\n<p>众筹的独特之处在于：承诺<strong>先于</strong>工程完成而签发，本质上是一次<strong>在锥形不确定性顶端做出的固定价估算</strong>。Barry Boehm 在《Software Engineering Economics》（1981）中指出早期估算区间可宽到 4 倍上下，而众筹恰要求在最宽的那一点给出具体月份。系统因此不能假设「承诺 = 计划」，只能假设「承诺 = 一个需用重排机制持续校准的目标」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;认投期签发承诺&lt;br/&gt;预计交付月份 (公开)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;内部里程碑计划&lt;br/&gt;模具 / 量产 / 到仓 / 发货&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;范围变更请求&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|采纳| D[&quot;范围扩大&lt;br/&gt;时间轴被挤压&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|拒绝| E[&quot;维持原范围&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F{&quot;缓冲消耗检测&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|缓冲充裕| G[&quot;按原承诺推进&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|缓冲耗尽| H[&quot;里程碑重排&lt;br/&gt;重新签发承诺日期&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;对外公告 + 补偿选择权&lt;br/&gt;退款 / 换档 / 换购&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; J[&quot;波次发货&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[\"认投期签发承诺&lt;br/&gt;预计交付月份 (公开)\"] --&gt; B[\"内部里程碑计划&lt;br/&gt;模具 / 量产 / 到仓 / 发货\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"范围变更请求\"}\n    C --&gt;|采纳| D[\"范围扩大&lt;br/&gt;时间轴被挤压\"]\n    C --&gt;|拒绝| E[\"维持原范围\"]\n    D --&gt; F{\"缓冲消耗检测\"}\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|缓冲充裕| G[\"按原承诺推进\"]\n    F --&gt;|缓冲耗尽| H[\"里程碑重排&lt;br/&gt;重新签发承诺日期\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"对外公告 + 补偿选择权&lt;br/&gt;退款 / 换档 / 换购\"]\n    G --&gt; J[\"波次发货\"]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>承诺、范围、时间构成一个<strong>不可同时满足的三角</strong>。最危险的操作是三边都不动——范围照加、日期不动、成本不加，缺口就只能靠<strong>质量或信任</strong>来填，而这两者恰是众筹里最不可再生的资源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更落点</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>谁承担代价</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>里程碑重排、公告新日期</td>\n<td>支持者等更久；品牌信任损耗</td>\n<td>可逆，但每次重排消耗信任额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>砍功能、降规格、拆发</td>\n<td>支持者拿到的与页面描述不符</td>\n<td>不可逆；可能触发虚假宣传投诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>项目方自行吸收超支</td>\n<td>项目方毛利甚至现金流</td>\n<td>不可逆；超支过量导致项目失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>向已认投者补收款</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><strong>不可行</strong>：认投金额已锁定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是铁律：<strong>认投金额在众筹结束时已锁定，项目方无权追加收费</strong>（Kickstarter 与 Indiegogo 条款均禁止众筹结束后要求额外付款，加购只能通过自愿的 pledge manager 完成）。超支这条出路被封死，能动的只有<strong>时间</strong>与<strong>范围</strong>——这解释了为什么<strong>范围蔓延是延期的头号驱动因素</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"范围蔓延的复利-为什么-再加一个功能-是延期最大来源\">范围蔓延的复利：为什么「再加一个功能」是延期最大来源</h2><p>范围蔓延（scope creep）指<strong>未经变更控制、交付范围随时间悄悄扩大</strong>。众筹语境下它有若干策源地，且都能被系统检测：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>蔓延来源</th>\n<th>典型触发场景</th>\n<th>可检测信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>众筹期新增档位/配件</td>\n<td>为冲高认投额临时加「限量版」</td>\n<td>档位表在认投期内被写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追加延伸目标（stretch goal）</td>\n<td>认投过半后宣布「解锁 XX 功能」</td>\n<td>承诺交付物集合在冻结后被修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持者驱动的功能请求</td>\n<td>评论区「能不能加个 Type-C」</td>\n<td>变更请求持续新增且被采纳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链替换</td>\n<td>芯片缺货，换型号需重新验证</td>\n<td>BOM 行版本在冻结后变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量返工</td>\n<td>质检不通过，批次回炉</td>\n<td>上架库存出现负向调整（参见 <a href=\"../reward-pack-ship/batch-wave-inventory-alloc\">批次波次发货计划与库存分配</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键直觉是：<strong>范围增长带来的工期增长不是线性的，而是带复利的</strong>。设每个新功能自身工时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，任意两功能间的集成、验证、包装与文档成本为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，则含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个额外功能的总增量工时近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(n) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} e_i + c\\binom{n}{2} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} e_i + \\frac{c\\,n(n-1)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>线性项看似很小，但<strong>二次项在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 变大时主导增长</strong>：加第 1 个功能的边际代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，加第 5 个已是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_5 + 4c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。项目通常在认投期情绪最高涨时连续解锁多个延伸目标，恰把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 推向二次项开始吃人的区间。由此得到第一条硬规则：<strong>交付范围必须在明确时点冻结（scope freeze），冻结后任何增补都须走变更控制，且必须显式换掉时间或质量</strong>。冻结点通常设在「众筹结束、pledge manager 开放在即」，此时档位与加购项构成才能确定，才能生成准确的 BOM 与装箱结构。变更请求进入评审后，核心问题只有一个——<strong>能否用现有进度缓冲吸收</strong>：能则采纳并扣减缓冲，不能则须由创始人裁决是「接受延期」还是「砍掉等量范围（scope swap）」，两者都留下审计记录。</p>\n<p>范围蔓延的深层原因是<strong>乐观偏差与规划谬误（planning fallacy）</strong>。Bent Flyvbjerg 对大型项目的「参考类别预测（reference class forecasting）」研究反复指出，决策者系统性低估工期与成本——基于全球大型项目的统计，<strong>绝大多数此类项目最终超出预算与工期</strong>。众筹项目方几乎全是无量产经验的小团队，这对它们不是「可能有偏差」而是「必然有偏差」。对策不是「更努力地估算」，而是<strong>用历史同类项目的实际分布去修正自报工期</strong>：不要问「我们这个要多久」，而要看「过去 100 个同类项目实际用了多久」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"里程碑重排-把一次延期变成有界的再承诺\">里程碑重排：把一次延期变成有界的再承诺</h2><p>延期本身不致命，<strong>失控的、反复无常的、每次只推迟两周的延期才致命</strong>。里程碑重排的目标是把一次不可避免的延期转化为<strong>有界、有解释、有补偿选项的再承诺</strong>，其工程实现含三件事。</p>\n<p><strong>一是缓冲账本。</strong> 借鉴 Goldratt 在《Critical Chain》（1997）中的缓冲管理思想——不在每条任务里塞安全时间，而是把安全时间集中成一个<strong>可见的项目缓冲</strong>并监控消耗速度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Burn</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>remain</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>临界条件： Burn</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Burn}(t) = 1 - \\frac{B_{\\text{remain}}(t)}{B_0},\\qquad \\text{临界条件：}\\ \\text{Burn}(t) \\ge \\frac{t}{D_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Burn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">临界条件：</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Burn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1281em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是初始缓冲（原计划工期与最乐观工期之差），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>remain</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{remain}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当前剩余缓冲，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是原计划总工期。第一式衡量缓冲已烧掉多少，第二式是<strong>触发条件</strong>：当缓冲消耗比例跑在时间消耗比例前面，项目已进入不可按原承诺交付的区间。其好处是<strong>不依赖对剩余工作的精确估算</strong>——只看两个可观测比例，就能在事后追责变成争论前发出预警。</p>\n<p><strong>二是里程碑状态机。</strong> 每个里程碑只允许处在有限状态，且状态跃迁必须带证据，否则「进度更新」会退化成「乐观地报告一切正常」。<strong>三是版本化的对外公告。</strong> 每次重排都产生一条不可变记录：旧日期、新日期、原因分类、补偿选项、下一次检查点——不仅对支持者透明，更让项目方无法悄悄漂移。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>里程碑状态</th>\n<th>判定条件</th>\n<th>允许的对外动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>On Track</td>\n<td>缓冲消耗比例 &lt; 时间消耗比例</td>\n<td>常规进度更新，不承诺新日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>At Risk</td>\n<td>缓冲消耗比例逼近时间消耗比例</td>\n<td>内部预警；准备备选供应商/备选方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rebaselined</td>\n<td>已执行一次重排并重新签发日期</td>\n<td>公告新日期 + 补偿选项 + 新检查点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slipped</td>\n<td>重排后的新日期再次被突破</td>\n<td>升级为「重大变更」，创始人出面 + 开放退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delivered</td>\n<td>首波发货完成</td>\n<td>公告发货证据（面单/物流号）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最关键的一条纪律是：<strong>同一层级的日期只允许重排有限次数</strong>。连续两次重排后仍无法交付，说明问题在「项目可行性」而非「排期」，系统必须升级到 Slipped 并开放退款，而不是继续发布第三个「新日期」。Kickstarter 条款要求项目方在无法按计划完成时<strong>如实沟通进展并提供解决方案</strong>——「反复给出无法兑现的新日期」恰是把一次可接受的延期升级为平台与监管层面问题的典型路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"法律与平台红线-延期在什么时点变成违约\">法律与平台红线：延期在什么时点变成违约</h2><p>核心判据是：<strong>这份回报在法律上是否构成一次「商品销售」？</strong> 若构成，各国消费者保护法中「约定时间内交付、否则退款」的规则即开始生效。</p>\n<p>在美国，联邦贸易委员会（FTC）的<strong>邮购规则（Mail Order Rule，16 CFR Part 435）<strong>规定：卖家须在</strong>声明的期限内</strong>发货，未声明则在 <strong>30 天内</strong>发货，无法按期须<strong>及时通知买家并提供取消订单、全额退款的选项</strong>。FTC 在 2015 年发布面向众筹的合规指引（<em>Crowdfunding and the FTC&#39;s Mail, Internet, or Telephone Order Merchandise Rule</em>），明确带实物回报的众筹<strong>可能适用该规则</strong>——页面上的「预计交付月份」一旦被认定为「声明期限」，逾期不发货且不提供退款就可能触犯联邦法。同年 FTC 对 Kickstarter 项目 <em>The Doom That Came to Atlantic City</em> 发起人 Erik Chevalier 提起执法并和解，确立先例：<strong>收款后不交付且挪用资金构成 FTC 法第 5 条下的欺骗性行为</strong>——这把「众筹延期」从社区道德问题重新定义为<strong>可被监管执法的消费者保护问题</strong>。</p>\n<p>欧盟侧规则需区分两类众筹，工程上不能混用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n<th>对交付/延期的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消费者权利指令 2011/83/EU</td>\n<td>面向消费者的远程销售合同</td>\n<td>给予 14 天撤回权；约定交付期未交付时消费者可催告并解除合同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧洲众筹服务提供者条例 (EU) 2020/1503</td>\n<td><strong>投资型/借贷型</strong>众筹平台（ECSP）</td>\n<td>平台持牌与信息披露要求；<strong>不适用于实物回报型众筹</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台条款（Kickstarter / Indiegogo）</td>\n<td>使用该平台的项目</td>\n<td>禁止认投期后追加收费；要求如实披露风险与进展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最容易踩的坑是把 (EU) 2020/1503 套到实物回报型众筹上——它管投资与借贷，不管「我给你一件产品」这种回报关系。工程含义是：<strong>「约定交付期」字段必须与「是否构成销售」的判定联动</strong>，一旦构成销售，逾期就要自动进入「通知 + 退款选项」流程，而非仅发一条道歉公告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品牌风险的沟通工程与度量\">品牌风险的沟通工程与度量</h2><p>延期对品牌的伤害，很大一部分<strong>不是来自延期本身，而是来自信息的空白</strong>：支持者能接受「慢」，但很难接受「失联」。沟通要被当作系统的一个<strong>确定性输出</strong>。可复用的公告结构含三段：<strong>发生了什么</strong>（用事实而非形容词，给照片/检测报告/物流号等证据）；<strong>改变了什么</strong>（明确新日期或明确「暂不承诺新日期」，并说明原因分类：供应/质量/物流/合规）；<strong>接下来是什么</strong>（下一个检查点日期，以及支持者此刻可做的选择）。</p>\n<p>第三段里的<strong>退出选项（exit ramp）<strong>是降低品牌损伤最有效的杠杆：当支持者感到被「困住」时愤怒会指数级放大，而当他们知道随时可拿回钱时，即使选择继续等待，情绪也会显著缓和。工程上这意味着退款不该是客服工单，而应是</strong>可由支持者自助发起、状态可追踪的订单操作</strong>。度量侧应把「品牌风险」拆成可观测输入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>预警含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承诺兑现率</td>\n<td>按时交付的支持者占比</td>\n<td>低于同类基线即需复盘估算方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延期天数分布</td>\n<td>实际交付日 − 承诺交付日</td>\n<td>右尾（极端延期）比均值更值得关注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新频率</td>\n<td>每 N 天至少一次进展公告</td>\n<td>频率下降是「项目失控」的领先指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款发起率</td>\n<td>主动退款支持者 / 总支持者</td>\n<td>快速上升说明信任正在流失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按参考类别预测的思路，<strong>绝对延期天数不是最该关注的，右尾才是</strong>：普通晚 2 个月的项目，与大部分准时、少数晚 18 个月的项目，品牌杀伤不在一个量级——后者会持续制造「我是不是被坑了」的公开叙事。系统的目标因而是<strong>压缩右尾</strong>：对少数可能长期无法交付的支持者尽早走退款或换档，而不是无限期挂在「等待队列」里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>承诺先于工程签发</strong>：预计交付日期是在不确定性最大的时刻做出的固定承诺，系统必须区分「可重排的内部里程碑」与「已生效的对外承诺」。</li>\n<li><strong>范围蔓延是延期的头号来源</strong>：追加收费在众筹中被平台条款<strong>物理封死</strong>，范围是唯一无需向支持者要钱就能扩容的维度，而它的工期代价带二次项复利。</li>\n<li><strong>范围冻结 + 变更控制</strong>：在认投结束、pledge manager 开放前冻结交付范围，此后任何增补必须显式换掉时间或质量，并留下审计记录。</li>\n<li><strong>缓冲账本是预警核心</strong>：用「缓冲消耗比例 vs 时间消耗比例」作为触发判据，不依赖对剩余工作的精确估算，就能在争论发生前发出重排信号。</li>\n<li><strong>重排必须有界</strong>：同一层级日期只允许有限次重排，连续失败必须升级并开放退款，而不是继续发布新的乐观日期。</li>\n<li><strong>法律红线在「是否构成销售」</strong>：FTC 邮购规则（16 CFR Part 435）与众筹合规指引、欧盟消费者权利指令，会在逾期不发货且不退款时把延期变成可执法的消费者保护问题；欧盟众筹条例 (EU) 2020/1503 只管投资型/借贷型众筹。</li>\n<li><strong>沟通是确定性输出</strong>：三段式公告 + 自助退出选项是压缩品牌损伤的两个杠杆；度量上应盯住延期分布的右尾，而非均值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承诺管理、范围蔓延与里程碑重排机制","id":"承诺管理-范围蔓延与里程碑重排机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺是提前签发的对外契约","id":"核心概念-承诺是提前签发的对外契约"},{"level":2,"text":"范围蔓延的复利：为什么「再加一个功能」是延期最大来源","id":"范围蔓延的复利-为什么-再加一个功能-是延期最大来源"},{"level":2,"text":"里程碑重排：把一次延期变成有界的再承诺","id":"里程碑重排-把一次延期变成有界的再承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"法律与平台红线：延期在什么时点变成违约","id":"法律与平台红线-延期在什么时点变成违约"},{"level":2,"text":"品牌风险的沟通工程与度量","id":"品牌风险的沟通工程与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"延期成因分类与沟通节奏模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-delay-risk-brand/delay-cause-communication"},"next":{"title":"退单拒付、投诉升级与品牌信任修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdfunding-reward-fulfillment/reward-delay-risk-brand/backer-chargeback-brand-trust"}}